  "problemStatement": "Estimate the remainder R_n for sum_{n=1}^oo 1/n^3 when approximated by the first n terms.",
  "finalAnswer": "\\frac{1}{2(n+1)^2} \\le R_n \\le \\frac{1}{2n^2}",
  "steps": [
