      "stepNumber": 2,
      "title": "Evaluate Upper and Lower Integrals",
      "mathExpression": "\\int_k^\\infty x^{-3} dx = \\left[ -\\frac{1}{2x^2} \\right]_k^\\infty = \\frac{1}{2k^2}",
      "explanation": "Evaluate the power integral.",
      "why": "Antiderivative computation."
    },
